  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, advanced parameter ContactTags do not have much utility because they are at odds with the \"matching\" purpose that tags are also used for. For instance, if you have different groups of contacts that interact with senders from their own group, they cannot have ANY tag overlap for \"data\" tags used by advanced parameters because then the different groups would interact with each other.\n\nI'd suggest that we could optionally override the list of \"advanced parameter\" tags, meaning the list of tags used for advanced parameters CollisionTag / material parameter tag bitflags.",
